  "NewsContent": "<div class=\"ExternalClassA11F9507E55A49D2A7CDD3A37C26EC88\"><div><strong>\u200bIsmaili Community Contributes $22 Million To Aga Khan University</strong></div><div><br></div><div>Daily Dawn</div><div>Date&#58; October 15, 2004</div><div><br></div><div>The Canadian Ismaili community opened its hearts and the purses to come up with what is being termed the most generous fund-raising effort in its history....&#160;</div><div><br></div><div><strong>Canadian Professionals Contribute $ 5.2 Million To Aga Khan University</strong></div><div><strong><br></strong></div><div>South Asian Outlook</div><div>Date&#58; October 14, 2004</div><div><br></div><div>Two hundred and sixty Canadian professionals, comprising physicians, lawyers, pharmacists, architects and other professions have pledged 5.2 million dollars in contributions to establish a 'Performing Arts Centre' at the Aga Khan University in Karachi...&#160;</div><div><br></div><div><strong>Canadians Pledge $5.2 Million To Aga Khan University</strong></div><div><strong><br></strong></div><div>The Weekly Voice</div><div>Date&#58; October 14, 2004</div><div><br></div><div>TORONTO, Oct 14&#58; A group of 260 Canadian professionals will contribute 5.2 million dollars to establish a Performing Arts Centre at the Aga Khan University in Karachi...<br></div></div>",
